  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AVP 2024 - Four PEs i) TCF II 433-224 ii) CORE 428-234 iii) EAC cross border 412-002 iv) BEGIN 430-034</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract inherited from multiple actions, related to: AVP 2024 - Four PEs i) TCF II 433-224 ii) CORE 428-234 iii) EAC cross border 412-002 iv) BEGIN 430-034 - This action is designed as a regional response to the various and growing security threats across the EAC region. The overall objective of the action is to prevent and decrease regional and cross border security threats. It builds on existing initiatives with the objective to accompany and extend the development of key synergies and complementarities, fully compliant with the EAC Peace and Security Strategy and Protocol as well as with the EU Policy Framework for Peace and Security in East Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
